---
title: Links
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: Links Josh Ghent has been reading, with notes on why each one was worth keeping.
permalink: /links/
---
<p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400"><a href="/links/feed.xml">Subscribe to links</a></p>
<div class="h-feed">
  <h2 class="sr-only p-name">Links</h2>
  <ul class="pl-0 space-y-6 list-none">
    {% for item in collections.links | reverse %}
      <li class="h-entry">
        <a class="u-url no-underline" href="{{ item.url }}"><time class="dt-published font-mono text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 tracking-wide" datetime="{{ item.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ item.date | fromISO }}</time></a>
        <div class="p-name"><a class="u-bookmark-of" href="{{ item.data.bookmark_of }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a></div>
        <div class="e-content text-sm mt-1 text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">{{ item.templateContent | safe }}</div>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
